<description>&lt;p&gt;Iranian drones have struck Kurdish opposition camps and the Komala headquarters in northern Iraq, while Israeli forces have hit weapons depots and air-defence warehouses inside the country, prompting Baghdad to accuse Israel and probe the closure of Iran border crossings amid protests. Iraq and the United States are discussing expanding their military partnership and joint security coordination, and Iraq’s foreign minister has spoken about increasing Iraq’s participation in UN peacekeeping operations. The conflict produced 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE9OeTc1VE5lcEx0QzNhVlh6TnBVZUhfdi1MR0xZQnJOLWo2U3dHb09ucVhPNXctSTFXNTF6R3EwZEJXSl96SF9zS2FPUWFwcHpHeFVMaGtUckZiaGIydHc1SFMwT3U1R1h5WnMtY2RGUkdtYm1jV2VUMWFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTFBMdTByenpSYnZJTExRdm51dVpMWVpUMHNBZFdNVWJ1UFd2Z0Z1TlJKcm8wN2JCWExLX0RlM2RISWpibUNKWEVpVXgyWTF6dElOaTFyNHJ5NmNqRXhVUi14TUdySQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rudaw&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiREFVX3lxTFBEckJBOUhoNFhKaTlWV2hZMDdhczBVSDYzUUxDUmZzdTBrdU5GSXZuSXBGWkZMVUJhLXZyRi01V0NvZ2lp?oc=5&quot;&gt;964media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTE9hOHUxQjYtTTdCOEthckhabHpnX0ZBd1FQd0c0MExTSUNyTlpoRlpNalNBVF81ODZjS1drLXJUVnh4WlFlVGg3RENwWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Region&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxOVnBzRXhLZzc3dnNzcWNRTG45VjBHNTd6a1BHYk9VQ2pKc3JVQlJPY2pDd3V5MHdBLWFhQ0FnWTRSWUsyTHBNQlQ0SmFJMU1vNENWNGJENDdWSDZiRElKVm42NU9tRU1XVkNXMU1YZjhjeWpDalh6SWh4SnZsb3d3OU9NV3VTMUlRZkNCSExNcXU?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/